 monthly triage for new instrumentation requests ranked by customer impact.`}},{id:`process-runbooks`,label:`Missing runbooks / playbooks`,suggestion:{action:`Author 3 incident playbooks that start in Dynatrace (detect → triage → escalate) for the highest-severity journeys.`,resource:{label:`Dynatrace Docs — Problems and alerting`,href:`https://docs.dynatrace.com/docs/observe-and-explore/problems`}}},{id:`process-change`,label:`Change control friction`,suggestion:{action:`Pre-approve a repeatable change pattern for OneAgent / OpenTelemetry rollout so expansions are not case-by-case.`}},{id:`process-cadence`,label:`No standing success cadence`,suggestion:{action:`Book a monthly 45-minute outcome review with the account team — coverage, MTTR, and adoption as standing metrics.`}}]},{id:`technology`,label:`Technology & tooling`,items:[{id:`tech-blindspots`,label:`Dark / partial districts`,suggestion:{action:`Pick the darkest high-impact district from Current State and set a 30-day coverage target with health scores tracked.`,resource:{label:`Dynatrace Docs — Infrastructure Observability`,href:`https://docs.dynatrace.com/docs/platform-modules/infrastructure-monitoring`}}},{id:`tech-sprawl`,label:`Tool sprawl / overlapping signals`,suggestion:{action:`Map which questions each tool answers today; designate Dynatrace as the system of record for incident triage.`}},{id:`tech-otel`,label:`OpenTelemetry fragmentation`,suggestion:{action:`Standardize an OTel → Dynatrace ingestion pattern and deprecate one-off collector configs.`,resource:{label:`Dynatrace Docs — OpenTelemetry`,href:`https://docs.dynatrace.com/docs/ingest-from/opentelemetry`}}},{id:`tech-mainframe`,label:`Mainframe / legacy blind spots`,suggestion:{action:`Run a discovery session on mainframe / legacy transaction paths and propose a phased visibility pilot.`,resource:{label:`Dynatrace Docs — Mainframe monitoring`,href:`https://docs.dynatrace.com/docs/platform-modules/infrastructure-monitoring/mainframe`}}},{id:`tech-noise`,label:`Alert noise / low trust in signals`,suggestion:{action:`Baseline noisy alerts for two weeks, then tune problem detection / alerting profiles with the on-call leads.`,resource:{label:`Dynatrace Docs — Alerting`,href:`https://docs.dynatrace.com/docs/observe-and-explore/davis-ai`}}}]},{id:`security`,label:`Security & compliance`,items:[{id:`sec-signoff`,label:`Security sign-off stalling rollout`,suggestion:{action:`Package a least-privilege rollout pattern for Security review once — reuse it for every subsequent expansion.`,resource:{label:`Dynatrace Docs — Security`,href:`https://docs.dynatrace.com/docs/platform-modules/application-security`}}},{id:`sec-least-priv`,label:`Least-privilege / IAM constraints`,suggestion:{action:`Define environment-scoped access policies and document the approved IAM roles for Dynatrace integrations.`}},{id:`sec-data-residency`,label:`Data residency / sovereignty`,suggestion:{action:`Confirm tenant region / data boundaries with Security and capture them in the partnership architecture brief.`}},{id:`sec-audit`,label:`Audit evidence still manual`,suggestion:{action:`Identify 2–3 audit evidence packs that Dynatrace can generate automatically and pilot them this quarter.`}},{id:`sec-findings`,label:`Security findings siloed from runtime`,suggestion:{action:`Connect Application Security findings to the same services used in incident response dashboards.`,resource:{label:`Dynatrace Docs — Application Security`,href:`https://docs.dynatrace.com/docs/platform-modules/application-security`}}}]},{id:`access`,label:`Access & environments`,items:[{id:`access-prod`,label:`Prod access / deploy rights`,suggestion:{action:`Secure a time-boxed prod change window and a named approver for the first instrumentation wave.`}},{id:`access-k8s`,label:`Cluster / namespace permissions`,suggestion:{action:`Request a Dynatrace operator / namespace install pattern approved by the platform team for EKS / OpenShift.`,resource:{label:`Dynatrace Docs — Kubernetes`,href:`https://docs.dynatrace.com/docs/platform-modules/infrastructure-monitoring/container-platform`}}},{id:`access-network`,label:`Network / egress restrictions`,suggestion:{action:`Document required egress endpoints and open a firewall change request with Network before the rollout date.`}},{id:`access-agents`,label:`Agent / OneAgent install blockers`,suggestion:{action:`Choose the install path (OneAgent, Operator, or OTel-only) that clears the current blocker and prove it in non-prod first.`,resource:{label:`Dynatrace Docs — OneAgent`,href:`https://docs.dynatrace.com/docs/ingest-from/dynatrace-oneagent`}}},{id:`access-saas`,label:`SaaS / tenant connectivity`,suggestion:{action:`Validate tenant connectivity and SSO from a representative prod-like host; capture any proxy requirements.`}}]},{id:`priority`,label:`Budget & priority`,items:[{id:`priority-funding`,label:`Funding / license headroom`,suggestion:{action:`Build a license / host-unit forecast tied to the 90-day coverage plan and socialize with procurement early.`}},{id:`priority-roadmap`,label:`Competing roadmap priorities`,suggestion:{action:`Align the Dynatrace MVP to one executive priority (e.g. incident speed or release safety) already on the roadmap.`}},{id:`priority-proof`,label:`Need clearer value proof`,suggestion:{action:`Pick one before/after metric (MTTR, coverage %, noisy alerts) and instrument a 30-day proof story for leadership.`}},{id:`priority-exec`,label:`Executive sponsorship thin`,suggestion:{action:`Identify a single exec sponsor and book a 20-minute readout after Current State + Roadblocks are captured.`}},{id:`priority-scope`,label:`Scope creep / unclear MVP`,suggestion:{action:`Write a one-page MVP: districts in scope, out of scope, and done criteria for day 30 / 60 / 90.`}}]}];function Eu(){return Tu.flatMap(e=>e.items)}function Du(e){let t=e.trim().toLowerCase();return Eu().find(e=>e.label.toLowerCase()===t)}function Ou(e){let t=(Array.isArray(e)?e:e.split(`
